    "intro_html":  "Real tamales mean masa, corn husks, a steamer, and an afternoon with people you like. Tamale pie is the Tex-Mex shortcut somebody invented when they wanted the flavor on a Wednesday. Chile-spiced turkey, black beans and green chiles under a scratch cornbread top studded with corn and cheese. Each serving carries \u003cstrong\u003e{{protein}} grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e and {{cal}} calories for about \u003cstrong\u003e${{cost_ps}}\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost).",
